<Article
  title="HTML to Markdown for AI With Links and Source Attribution"
  description="Convert HTML into LLM-ready Markdown without losing headings, links, or provenance. Ollagraph shows how to keep citations traceable to the source page."
  date="2026-07-29"
  readingTime={23}
